# INSTRUCTIONS FOR NEW USERS:
# 1. Rename this file from '.env.example' to '.env'
# 2. Generate a secure, random 64-character hexadecimal string (32 bytes).
#    You can generate one using Python:
#    python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
# 3. Replace the placeholder below with your new key.
# 4. Make sure this EXACT SAME key is placed in the .env file on ALL your devices.

SECRET_KEY=replace_this_with_your_32_byte_hex_key_here
